# ---- OS / editor ---------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json

# Vendored Microsoft interop assemblies. Committed deliberately so the build is hermetic -- see
# lib/README.md. Without this negation the *.dll rule above silently excludes them and a fresh clone
# cannot compile, which is exactly the failure vendoring was meant to prevent.
!lib/*.dll
